      "description": {
        "en": "Foreign-IM channel set for DeepSeek Harness: Telegram, Discord, Slack, Mattermost, Zulip and Matrix in one plugin, with a Settings page (add / test / save channels, live reload), per-conversation sessions that survive restarts, and platform-correct markdown. All six connect outbound — no public callback URL needed.",
        "zh": "DeepSeek Harness 的多平台 IM 通道集合：一个插件接入 Telegram、Discord、Slack、Mattermost、Zulip 与 Matrix。带设置页（增删通道、测试凭据、保存即生效），会话按频道持久化、重启后自动接回，并按平台转成正确的 markdown 方言。六个平台都是主动连出去，不需要公网回调。"
      },
